            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "The specific combination of the substances contained in the cataplasm is widely acknowledged in the literature for its soothing properties. White willow and its derivatives are used for joint function, likewise Boswellia is known for its beneficial properties and used to relieve tension. The essential oils contained are also very active as soothing, myorelaxant, and detoxifying. The wellbeing generated by the compress with this cataplasm comes from the protective and softening effect of the formulation.",
