              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "During the application there is a feeling of cold/heat, which happens regularly, due to the formulation; it is also normal to feel a “burning” sensation for the first 30 minutes or so of application. If this reaction persists, it is advisable to remove the patch and rinse with warm water. The first time treat only one area and, if well tolerated, get to 2/3 zones maximum. The skin after the compress may remain red for a few hours.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "Adjuvant for all muscle-joint problems, it can also be used in combination with therapies in case of trauma, bruises, sprains, strains, low back pain, cervical pain, inflammation and pain in the hips, knees, feet, shoulders, elbows, and hands. In the same way, it can be associated to therapies in case of tallonitis, bunions, arthrosis and arthritis, sciatica, epicondylitis, and tendinitis in general.",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            },
            {
              "detail": 0,
              "format": 0,
              "mode": "normal",
              "style": "",
              "text": "The experience gained since 1956 at the Phytotherapy Centre Zanellato is now available for everybody and everywhere, thanks to the shipping of the practical patches that you can apply with ease at home. ",
              "type": "text",
              "version": 1
            }
          ],
